  "title": "Buttermilk Oatmeal Waffles",
  "description": "This buttermilk oatmeal waffle recipes includes egg whites, beaten and folded in to create a light texture — crisp on the outside, tender on the inside.",
  "authors": [
    "Mike Mader"
